// src/ui/chat_screen.cplus — an open run view.
//
// Centre: the run's title, the transcript (markdown answers, the person's
// messages as bubbles on the right, approvals as lime cards with the
// command and its choices) and the composer with Model / Effort / Approvals
// chips. Right: a tabbed panel — Run (a timeline of thoughts, tool calls
// and the approval being waited on), Browser, Terminal (command output)
// and Preview (file changes).
//
// Retained facet component: `build` runs once; everything after that is a
// write onto the live tree driven by the conversation, sessions and engine
// signals.

